---
id: cfp-faq
title: CFP FAQ
description: "Questions and answers about speaking at KCD Your City 2099: who can submit, what we look for, how talks are selected and what speakers get."
# Goes live with the call for papers (`open: true` and the questions in
# cfp.yaml, the menu entry in nav.yaml): delete the line then. Put it back
# when the call closes if the answers should go down with it.
draft: true
---
{{ layout "layouts/page.vto" }}

{{# The CFP FAQ: `cfp.faq` through `faq.list`, under an intro that names the deadline while the CFP is open. The page stays up after the CFP closes, so it reads `cfp.open` and, for the hours in between, the deadline through timed text. #}}

{{ set ledeOpen }}
    Everything you need to know before you submit. The call for papers is
    open until
    <time
        datetime="{{ cfp.deadline }}"
        class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-primary"
    >{{ cfp.deadline |> formatDate("datetime") }}</time>.
{{ /set }}
{{ set ledeClosed = "The call for papers is closed. The answers stay up for the next edition; follow us to hear when it opens." }}

{{ comp ui.section { width: "3xl" } }}
    {{ comp ui.heading {
        level: 1,
        pill: "Call for papers",
        title: "Speaking at KCD Your City",
        lede: cfp.open ? { html: ledeOpen, until: cfp.deadline, after: ledeClosed } : ledeClosed,
    } }}
        {{ if cfp.open }}
            {{ comp ui.actions }}
                {{ comp ui.until { time: cfp.deadline } }}
                    {{ comp.ui.button({
                        label: "Submit your talk",
                        href: cfp.url,
                        icon: "fa-microphone-lines",
                        style: "primary",
                        external: true,
                    }) }}
                {{ /comp }}
                {{ comp ui.after { time: cfp.deadline } }}
                    {{ comp.ui.button({
                        label: "Submissions closed",
                        icon: "fa-microphone-lines",
                        style: "primary",
                        disabled: true,
                    }) }}
                {{ /comp }}
            {{ /comp }}
        {{ /if }}
    {{ /comp }}

    {{ comp.faq.list({ items: cfp.faq }) }}
{{ /comp }}

<!-- Help -->
{{ comp ui.cta { title: "Still have a question?", label: "Ask on Discord", href: social.discord, icon: "fa-brands fa-discord", external: true, padding: "bottom" } }}
    Ask the organisers on Discord. We are happy to read a draft
    proposal before you submit it.
{{ /comp }}
